					"content": "好乖好乖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760500907
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760500907,
					"content": "#它們喜歡{F#妳}{M#你}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760500908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760500908,
					"content": "#我能感覺到，當這些孩子靠近{F#妳}{M#你}的時候，它們本身也放鬆了下來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760500909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760500909,
					"content": "#就像凜角鹿喜歡沐浴著月光生長，月靈們也喜歡{F#妳}{M#你}心中散發出的什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760500910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760500910,
					"content": "嗯？那是什麼呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760500911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760500911,
					"content": "溫柔與善良吧。",
